<title>FINLAND: Finnish Feb PPI falls 1.8 pct yr/yr -SF. [CORRECTED 07:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Finnish Feb PPI falls 1.8 pct yr/yr -SF. [CORRECTED 07:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;Finnish Feb PPI rises 0.2 pct&quot;)</p>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index fell 1.8 percent in February year-on-year (corrects from &quot;on January&quot;), and it rose 0.2 percent month-on-month (corrects from &quot;year-on-year&quot;), Statistics Finland said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>			   Feb 1997		   Jan 1997	Feb 1996</p>
<p>   Mth/Mth	     +0.2 pct (corrects)    -0.1 pct	-0.1 pct</p>
<p>   Yr/Yr		 -1.8 pct (corrects)    -2.1 pct	+2.6 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
